          "component_id": "card_skill",
          "layout": "",
          "data": "{\"moduleName\":\"召唤物\",\"layout_\":\"left\",\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"沙龙成员\",\"skill_type\":\"召唤物\",\"icon\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/11/21/258999284/8cfed9e54e85d3bd44fc7e7e3aa9564a_278090355620995929.png\",\"life\":0,\"life_bg\":0,\"energy\":0,\"energy_bg\":0,\"desc\":{\"key\":\"召唤物效果\",\"value\":[\"<p><strong>结束阶段：</strong>对我方受伤最少的角色造成1点<strong><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"><u>穿透伤害</u></span></strong><span data-type=\\\"详情\\\" data-name=\\\"<p><strong><span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot;>穿透伤害：</span></strong></p><p>穿透伤害无法受到伤害加成，但是也无法被护盾、伤害免疫等效果抵消。</p>\\\" class=\\\"wiki-note-text\\\"><sup class=\\\"wiki-sup\\\">[详情]</sup></span>，对敌方受伤最少的角色造成<strong><span style=\\\"color: rgb(24, 144, 255)\\\"><u>水元素伤害</u></span></strong><span data-type=\\\"详情\\\" data-name=\\\"<p><strong>水元素伤害：</strong></p><p>附着水元素，可发生元素反应</p><p>每点<strong>元素精通</strong>使特定效果提升1倍。</p><p><strong>蒸发：</strong>本伤害翻倍，每8点元素精通额外翻1倍</p><p><strong>感电：</strong>所有敌方角色受到1点穿透伤害</p><p><strong>冻结：</strong>目标附属4层<strong>冻伤</strong></p><p><strong>绽放：</strong>生成1层<strong>草原核</strong></p><p></p>\\\" class=\\\"wiki-note-text\\\"><sup class=\\\"wiki-sup\\\">[详情]</sup></span>，触发3次。</p>\"]},\"tab_id\":\"1730815724349_0\"},{\"tab_name\":\"默认标题\",\"skill_type\":\"召唤物\",\"icon\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/11/21/258999284/e223897c5723dcc6b6ea50fcdf966232_4773691476502877626.png\",\"life\":0,\"life_bg\":0,\"energy\":0,\"energy_bg\":0,\"desc\":{\"key\":\"召唤物效果\",\"value\":[\"<p><strong>结束阶段：</strong>治疗我方受伤最多角色，触发3次。</p>\"]},\"tab_id\":\"1732192216765_1\"}],\"baseInfoSwitchDisabled\":false}",
